# A standalone DATA expression. Run with:
#   cargo run --quiet -- examples/pure_data.jtv --mode data
#
# Uses all four spellings of addition. DATA numbers are i64 in this
# implementation (checked addition: overflow is an error, not a wrap).
# The original Python PoC used exact rationals and this file read
# `1/3 plus 1/3 added_to 1/3`; a rational literal like `1/3` is now
# rejected with a parse error. See README, "DATA numbers".
40 plus 1 added_to 0 with 1 + 0
